WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:14.421
It was a bright Christmas morning.

2
00:00:14.422 --> 00:00:17.912
Bada: Is it morning yet?

3
00:00:17.913 --> 00:00:21.813
My present! Hana, get up!

4
00:00:21.814 --> 00:00:25.130
It's Christmas morning!

5
00:00:25.131 --> 00:00:31.442
Hana: Huh? Oh, yes!

6
00:00:31.443 --> 00:00:33.849
Bada: Where is my gift?

7
00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:36.308
Here it is!

8
00:00:36.309 --> 00:00:39.387
Wow, it's heavy.

9
00:00:39.388 --> 00:00:44.684
Hana: Here is mine too.

10
00:00:44.685 --> 00:00:48.854
Bada: Wow, how cool! Dad, look!

11
00:00:48.855 --> 00:00:55.194
Bada: These roller blades are exactly what I wanted! All right!

12
00:00:55.195 --> 00:00:57.846
Hana: This camera is perfect.

13
00:00:57.847 --> 00:01:02.336
Thank you, Santa!

14
00:01:02.337 --> 00:01:07.405
Bada: Mom, may I try the roller blades right now?

15
00:01:07.406 --> 00:01:13.075
Mom: You can go out after you eat breakfast, Bada.

16
00:01:13.076 --> 00:01:16.756
Bada: Boy, I am hungry.

17
00:01:16.757 --> 00:01:23.948
Mom, please fix me some breakfast quickly!

18
00:01:23.949 --> 00:01:26.152
What a sweet day.

19
00:01:26.153 --> 00:01:38.142
Merry Christmas, everyone!
